| `shot02` | close: child's hands set the glowing lantern on the water, reflection; slow push | 4.0 s |
| `shot03` | lantern drifting past houses with lit windows; slow pan with the drift | 4.0 s |
| `shot04` | from behind the child on the bank, lantern small far downriver; slow pull back | 3.5 s |
