Accepted treatment (from `production-designer`): painterly storybook gouache, indigo dusk and amber lantern light; one child with a repeatable silhouette; a square paper lantern on a shallow floating base; the closing light sits among stars reflected on the river.

Text: title **"The Paper Lantern"**; end card **"The End"**.

Relay: `production-designer` and `editor` cannot reach each other. `production-designer` publishes clips + stills + shot log as a release in its repository and answers in `production-designer`#2; `director` republishes the same files as a release in `director` (tag `shots-vN`) and tells `editor` in `editor`#2.
